{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"madeleine-mcgraw","name":"Madeleine McGraw","birthDate":"2008-12-22","birthPlace":"San Jose, California, USA","bio":"Madeleine Grace McGraw (born December 22, 2008) is an American actress. She gained recognition for her roles in various horror-themed projects, including Outcast (2016–2018) and The Black Phone (2021), which earned her a Saturn Award nomination for Best Performance by a Younger Actor.\n\nShe also starred as Zoey Campbell in the Disney Channel series Secrets of Sulphur Springs (2021–2023) and has since portrayed a younger version of Hope van Dyne in the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU) film Ant-Man and the Wasp (2018) and the Disney+ series What If...? (2023).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Madeleine McGraw, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:25:44+00:00","tmdbId":1530558,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1530558","credits":[{"id":"antman-wasp","title":"Ant-Man and the Wasp","character":"Young Hope"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/madeleine-mcgraw.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Other Worlds: A Stranger Things Adventure (2028)","year":2028,"character":"To be Announced","mediaType":"tv","poster":""},{"name":"Double Trouble","year":2026,"character":"Charlotte","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/2ecp59fHPF5Uq6vRQ6CJtyx4iAp.jpg"},{"name":"Tell Me Some Creepier Stories","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1NC7v0OT2GwjjoFFBwBhZsK4T7q.jpg"},{"name":"Black Phone 2","year":2025,"character":"Gwen","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vBOpqxW0SDhACwEO2LZT29DuNG2.jpg"},{"name":"Captain Tsunami","year":2025,"character":"Emma","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/htnjSxjHZy74FtucmMfjDcLTS7Y.jpg"},{"name":"The Curse of the Necklace","year":2024,"character":"Judith Davis","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https